a:2:{s:7:"content";s:903:"<p>Meeting of All Pakistan Marble Industries Association (APMIA) members including Senior Vice Chairman Muhammad Bilal Khan, Haji Shabbir Ahmed, Atiq ur Rehman Abbasi, Ilyas Muhammad with Secretary Industries &amp; Commerce, Balochistan in Islamabad regarding the issues of marble industries sector, we reached to following conclusions which are hereunder;</p>
<p>i) Haji Shabbir Ahmed’s inclusion in Board of Directors of Lasbela Industrial Estate Development Authority (LIEDA).</p>
<p>ii) To avoid electricity shut down and an alternate solution of 10MW self power generation is also verbally approved.</p>
<p>iii) Managing Director LIEDA has instructed by the secretary to meet our delegation in his upcoming visit to marble city in Gaddani.</p>
<p>iv) Secretary Industries also accepted that private entrepreneurs should develop Phase II Marble City under the government rules and regulations.</p>";s:12:"content_meta";N;}